                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty good western-themed platform game, sporting some very nice Atari 2600 retro-graphics (along with matching SFX) & an old tv-screen filter.  Definitely not easy, but that's part of its charm, I guess.  \n\nI played this several months ago and recently decided to come back and play again;  unfortunately, my old save was gone - probably due to an update (incompatibility issue) - so I'm going to have to start over, which is unfortunate - but not a big deal really...",
